Yes: choice. You might want to choose whether you enhance bow or long
sword. You might want to enhance knife now, or you might want to wait
until you've scored the few more hits you need for that long sword your
god gave you. You might want to enhance healing spells to basic now, or
you might want to gain another level to enhance attack spells to expert.
In short, you can make strategic decisions on which skill to enhance,
and when, and the game cannot make these decisions for you.

